0,Tebi Rex - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tebi_Rex,"December 25, 2025 - Tebi Rex was formed in Maynooth in 2016 by Max Zanga and Matt O'Baoill. Tebi Rex's music has been described as alternative indie-hip hop pop, a sound catalysed by the duality between the duo's two styles. Max Zanga is the rapper while Matt O'Baoill is his melodic foil, providing hooks and choruses.",Tebi,Pauwasi
